FY2025 Alphabet 如何描述 Other Bets 的业务和收入来源？
DRAFT:
{"status":"answered","claims":[{"text":"Alphabet 将 Other Bets 描述为一组处于不同发展阶段的业务投资组合：从研发阶段的 X，到正在扩大商业化的 Waymo。它们作为独立公司运营，部分公司还有独立董事会和外部投资者。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000114-f5db1f8d","quote":"businesses that are at various stages of development"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000115-2c911087","quote":"operate as independent companies"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000115-2c911087","quote":"some of them have their own boards with independent members and outside investors"}]},{"text":"收入来源方面，Alphabet 说明 Other Bets 的收入主要来自自动驾驶交通服务和互联网服务的销售；并且披露其中一些业务已经在产生收入。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000115-2c911087","quote":"some of them are already generating revenue"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000115-2c911087","quote":"Revenues from Other Bets are generated primarily from the sale of autonomous transportation and internet services."},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000458-61bfa72c","quote":"generated primarily from the sale of autonomous transportation services and internet services"}]}],"limitations":[],"findings":["FY2025 10-K 中，Other Bets 被定义为“non-Google businesses collectively”，并被描述为多项不同阶段的业务组合。","披露中举例包括 X（研发/突破性技术）和 Waymo（向更多城市扩张、进入国际市场、扩大运营）。","Other Bets 的收入来源被明确写为主要来自 autonomous transportation services 和 internet services 的销售。"],"stop_reason":"已定位并读取FY2025 10-K中Other Bets相关业务与收入来源披露。"}
REVIEW:
{"status":"answered","claims":[{"text":"FY2025中，Alphabet把Other Bets描述为由多个经营分部组成、且这些分部并非各自单独重大。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-001238-a179d53a","quote":"combination of multiple operating segments"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-001233-46924ceb","quote":"We report our segment results as Google Services, Google Cloud, and Other Bets"}]}],"limitations":["本次已能核实Other Bets的业务定义和收入来源，但未进一步展开具体成员业务（如X、Waymo）的逐项描述，因为用户问题只问Other Bets整体。"],"findings":["原draft的“从研发阶段的 X，到正在扩大商业化的 Waymo”并非Other Bets总体定义；FY2025文本仅在Other Bets章节外说明包含多个经营分部。","原draft称“作为独立公司运营，部分公司还有独立董事会和外部投资者”在所读FY2025可核查原文中未见，不能据此作为Other Bets整体描述。","原draft把收入来源表述得过窄且带有扩展解释；FY2025原文明确写的是“主要来自 autonomous transportation services 和 internet services 的销售”。","需要区分业务描述与收入来源：业务层面是“multiple operating segments / not individually material”，收入层面是“primarily from the sale of autonomous transportation services and internet services”。"],"stop_reason":"已用FY2025 10-K原文核实并纠正draft中对Other Bets业务与收入来源的概括。"}
